      "name": "review-log-watch",
      "title": "Review-log watch",
      "description": "Poll a review log (a drafting Contributor Feedback sheet, or a public-comment sheet's Review Change Sets) and its folio repository's issues mechanically, with Tool `review-log-watch`, and start agent work only when a cell people set or an open issue changed. Each issue that no row links yet becomes a Contributor Feedback row, and a closed issue's row is hidden with its text struck through. Use on every wake of a review-log watcher, and when setting up a watcher for a new log.",
